2. No plugin found for prefix 'sonar'

In pom.xml we must add below plugin when perming sonar anlysis using maven.
The plugin is required only for Maven-based Sonar analysis.
<plugin>
    <groupId>org.sonarsource.scanner.maven</groupId>
    <artifactId>sonar-maven-plugin</artifactId>
    <version>5.2.0.4988</version>
</plugin>

The Sonar Maven Plugin is required only when SonarQube analysis is executed through Maven using the sonar:sonar goal.
If a standalone Sonar Scanner is used, code quality analysis
can be performed without adding the plugin to the pom.xml. In my case, Jenkins was executing mvn sonar:sonar,
so Maven needed the Sonar Maven Plugin to recognize and execute the Sonar analysis goal.









